    <description>Platform-Event Triggered Flow that listens for the creation of the Lead Assignment Platform event. It will then assign the correct owner to the Lead.
v0.1: Included Lead Id in the Assignment elements to prevent errors in the Lead Update element
v1: Corrected error in Get Dealer Account element
v2: Removed Golden Copy Permission from Skip Automation conditions to allow for Integration User
v3: Updated Customer ID to Golden Copy field
v4: Included null condition in Get Dealer Account lookup</description>
    <formulas>
        <name>CurrentStageTrimmed</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT( {!$Flow.CurrentStage}, 32768)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>FaultMessageTrimmed</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT( {!$Flow.FaultMessage}, 32768)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>GC Lead Assignment Handler Flow {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>GC Lead Assignment Platform Event Handler</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
